  "content": "<h1>異界起源</h1><h3>種族、職業等內容，基於DND 5e規則手冊</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>種族/職業說明：</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fotherworld.wiki%252fmods%252fotherworld-origins%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看異界Wiki的起源頁面！（施工中）</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>undefined</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" alt=\"\"></a></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/muon-rw/Otherworld-Origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/muonr/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/curseforge-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmuon-rw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" alt=\"\"></a></h5><p></p><p>這是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins (Forge)</a>模組的附加內容，與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justleveling-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustLeveling [Fork]</a>及其他多個模組緊密整合，專為異界模組包設計。</p><p>它新增了種族、亞種、職業、副職業、可選專長系統（與升級進度整合）、根據你的起源調整Just Leveling的屬性/上限、搭配Iron's Spells n' Spellbooks的可選戲法，以及更多內容。</p><p><strong>此模組擁有大量非可選依賴項，可能存在我們未測試的相容性問題，且許多配置與平衡調整對最佳體驗至關重要。本模組專為異界模組包<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/otherworld-dnd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">（連結）</a>設計，歡迎您嘗試在其他環境使用，但我們將無法提供任何支援。</strong></p>",
